<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Keep the incense burning”</l><l>On the altar fire;</l><l>Feed the flame, Lord Jesus,</l><l>Till Thy whole desire</l><l>Shall in us, Thy children,</l><l>Find free course, and be</l><l>Breathed through lips anointed</l><l>For this ministry.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“Keep the incense burning”</l><l>Though thy faith be weak;</l><l>Though in words thou canst not</l><l>All thy longing speak;</l><l>Silent heart-petitions,</l><l>Spirit-taught, will be</l><l>Gloriously answered;</l><l>Wrought by God for thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Keep the incense burning,”</l><l>Hourly let it rise,</l><l>Till from opened heavens,</l><l>Till from flame-swept skies,</l><l>Fire shall fall and kindle</l><l>All hearts to a flame;</l><l>Making us a glory</l><l>To our Savior’s name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
